          %title Anyonic topological order in terms of braided fusion categories
          %h3#AnyonicTopologicalOrderInTermsOfBraidedFusionCategoriesReferences Anyonic topological order in terms of braided fusion categories
          %h4#claim_and_status Claim and status
          %p
            In
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/condensed+matter+theory"} condensed matter theory
            it is
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/folklore"} folklore
            that species of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anyon"} anyonic
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+order"} topological order
            correspond to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/braided+monoidal+categories"} braided
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unitary+fusion+category"} unitary
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fusion+categories"} fusion categories
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modular+tensor+categories"} modular tensor categories
          %p The origin of the claim is:
          %ul
            %li#Kitaev06
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexei+Kitaev"}> Alexei Kitaev
              , Section 8 and Appendix E of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Anyons in an exactly solved model and beyond
              %strong 321
              1 (2006) 2-111 [
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aop.2005.10.005"}> doi:10.1016/j.aop.2005.10.005
              ]
          %p Early accounts re-stating this claim (without attribution):
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chetan+Nayak"}> Chetan Nayak
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+H.+Simon"} Steven H. Simon
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ady+Stern"} Ady Stern
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Freedman"} Michael Freedman
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sankar+Das+Sarma"} Sankar Das Sarma
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Non-Abelian Anyons and Topological Quantum Computation
                %strong 80
                1083 (2008) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.80.1083"}> doi:10.1103/RevModPhys.80.1083
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0707.1889"} arXiv:0707.1888
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhenghan+Wang"}> Zhenghan Wang
                , Section 6.3 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological Quantum Computation
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 112
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/publications/authors/books/postpub/cbms-112"} ISBN-13: 978-0-8218-4930-9]
          %p Further discussion (mostly review and mostly without attribution):
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Simon+Burton"}> Simon Burton
                ,
                %em A Short Guide to Anyons and Modular Functors
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1610.05384"}> arXiv:1610.05384
                ]
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (this one stands out as still attributing the claim to
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "#Kitaev06"} Kitaev (2006), Appendix E
            %li#RowellWang18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+C.+Rowell"}> Eric C. Rowell
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhenghan+Wang"} Zhenghan Wang
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Mathematics of Topological Quantum Computing
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.06206"} arXiv:1705.06206
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/bull/1605"} doi:10.1090/bull/1605
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tian+Lan"}> Tian Lan
                ,
                %em A Classification of (2+1)D Topological Phases with Symmetries
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1801.01210"}> arXiv:1801.01210
                ]
            %li
              %p
                K. Beer et al.:
                %em From categories to anyons: a travelogue
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.06670"}> arXiv:1811.06670
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Colleen+Delaney"}> Colleen Delaney
                ,
                %em A categorical perspective on symmetry, topological order, and quantum information
                (2019) [
                %a{:href => "https://escholarship.org/uc/item/5z384290"} uc:5z384290&gt;,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://crdelane.pages.iu.edu/dissertationch1-5.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Colleen+Delaney"}> Colleen Delaney
                ,
                %em Lecture notes on modular tensor categories and braid group representations
                (2019) [
                %a{:href => "http://web.math.ucsb.edu/~cdelaney/MTC_Notes.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/DelaneyModularTensorCategories.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                Liang Wang,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhenghan+Wang"} Zhenghan Wang
                = succeed "," do
                  %em In and around Abelian anyon models
                %strong 53
                505203 (2020) [
                %a{:href => "https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1751-8121/abc6c0"}> doi:10.1088/1751-8121/abc6c0
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Parsa+Bonderson"}> Parsa Bonderson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Measuring Topological Order
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 3
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevResearch.3.033110"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevResearch.3.033110
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.05677"} arXiv:2102.05677
            %li
              %p
                Zhuan Li, Roger S.K. Mong,
                %em Detecting topological order from modular transformations of ground states on the torus
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.04329"}> arXiv:2203.04329
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Liang+Kong"}> Liang Kong
                , Zhi-Hao Zhang:
                %em An invitation to topological orders and category theory
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.05565"}> arXiv:2205.05565
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+C.+Rowell"}> Eric C. Rowell
                ,
                %em Braids, Motions and Topological Quantum Computing
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.11762"}> arXiv:2208.11762
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sachin+Valera"}> Sachin Valera
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Quick Introduction to the Algebraic Theory of Anyons
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CQTS"} CQTS
                  Initial Researcher Meeting
                (Sep 2022)
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/CQTS-InitialResearcherMeeting-Valera-220914.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                Willie Aboumrad,
                %em Quantum computing with anyons: an F-matrix and braid calculator
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.00831"}> arXiv:2212.00831
                ]
            %li#Simon23
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+H.+Simon"}> Steven H. Simon
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological Quantum
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://global.oup.com/academic/product/topological-quantum-9780198886723"} ISBN:9780198886723
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/SteveSimon/topological2021/TopoBook-Sep28-2021.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/SteveSimon/topological2021/topocourse2021.html"} webpage
            %li
              %p
                Siu-Hung Ng,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+C.+Rowell"} Eric C. Rowell
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"} Xiao-Gang Wen
                %em Classification of modular data up to rank 12
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.09670"}> arXiv:2308.09670
                ]
          %p
            Approaches towards rigorous derivation of anyon fusion category structure via
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/DHR+theory"} DHR theory
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+quantum+field+theory"} algebraic quantum field theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pieter+Naaijkens"}> Pieter Naaijkens
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Localized endomorphisms in Kitaev’s toric code on the plane
                %strong 23
                (2011) 347-373 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0129055X1100431X"}> doi:10.1142/S0129055X1100431X
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1012.3857"} arXiv:1012.3857
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pieter+Naaijkens"}> Pieter Naaijkens
                \:
